            ("p", "The next stage, organizational AI enablement, looks completely different. It means the organization itself, not just a handful of power users, has durable AI capability. Workflows are automated in a way that survives turnover. Institutional knowledge is captured in a system rather than trapped in someone's head. New employees inherit capability on day one instead of building it from scratch. That shift, from individual cleverness to organizational infrastructure, is the single biggest unlock most companies are missing right now, and it's exactly the gap that Microsoft Copilot Studio is built to close."),
